        "name": "dsh-global-todo",
        "title": {
          "en": "Global Todos",
          "zh": "全局待办"
        },
        "description": {
          "en": "Cross-session todos for DeepSeek Harness whose central rule is that an agent's \"done\" is not completion. Whether the agent reports it from a tool or the host infers it when a dispatched conversation ends cleanly, the record waits in Needs review: a person confirms it, or it goes back to the list. One JSON file you own, written by both sides, with created time, description, attached documents and links, a plan of steps and the sentence it came from; hand an item to a conversation in one click and read back what that conversation last said.",
          "zh": "DeepSeek Harness 的跨会话待办清单，中心规则是：Agent 说「做完了」不算完成。它自己在工具里报完成，或交给的会话干净收尾后宿主自动收尾，两条路都只进「待确认」，人点头才算完成、退回就回清单。一份属于你的 JSON 文件，人和 Agent 读写同一条记录：加入时间、描述、文档与地址、步骤计划、原话；一键交给某个对话继续干，随时回读那边最后说了什么。"
        },
